[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892904440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106620#issuecomment-2892904440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106620","id":2892904440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sbjf4","user":{"login":"OffsetMOSFET","id":91294328,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMjk0MzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91294328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET","html_url":"https://github.com/OffsetMOSFET","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-20T04:29:57Z","updated_at":"2025-05-20T04:29:57Z","body":"Note that the example uses whole numbers to avoid floating-point errors, though that does not guarantee the internal math avoids it too.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892904440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2893906325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106620#issuecomment-2893906325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106620","id":2893906325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sfYGV","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-20T10:55:29Z","updated_at":"2025-05-20T10:57:16Z","body":"This indeed looks like a floating point errors. What seems to be problematic is the Basis of the CSGs, as 90 degrees rotations introduce errors:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0cf409b4-855a-4e3a-9f99-ba2bfd92a74e)\n\nThe above produces Basis with such basis vectors:\n```\nX: (1.000000000000, 0.000000000000, 0.000000000000)\nY: (0.000000000000, -0.000000043711, 1.000000000000)\nZ: (0.000000000000, -1.000000000000, -0.000000043711)\n```\n\nGetting rid of those near zero values on `Combine Side-Side` and `Combine Bottom-Side` makes the issue go away for them:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends CSGCombiner3D\n\n@export_tool_button(\"Fix children basis\") var fix_children_basis_action = fix_children_basis\n\nfunc fix_children_basis() -> void:\n\tfor child in get_children():\n\t\tprint()\n\t\tprint(format_basis(child.basis))\n\t\tfor axis in 3:\n\t\t\tchild.basis[axis] = child.basis[axis].round()\n\t\tprint(format_basis(child.basis))\n\nfunc format_basis(basis: Basis) -> String:\n\tvar coord_format := \"%14.12v\"\n\tvar axes_format := \"X: %s, Y: %s, Z: %s\" % [coord_format, coord_format, coord_format]\n\treturn axes_format % [basis.x, basis.y, basis.z]\n```\n\nBottom-Side<br>![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad83baa8-a99f-467a-87f2-922ee2674aa5)|Side-Side<br>![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/245bc503-68cf-46ab-87d4-bc399b0ff7a6)\n-|-\n\nNote that:\n- For the Bottom-Side case the large CSG is not rotated, so it somehow makes sense that the small rotated CSGs with the erroneous Basis ended considered as not coplanar, and hence faces were not joined.\n- For the Side-Side case the large CSG is also rotated, it had the same erroneous Basis as the small rotated CSGs, hence it's rather unexpected that some of the small CSGs were not joined correctly. And this indicates it might an issue about CSG merger, not just problematic Basis.\n\nAlso:\n- For the Bottom-Top case no CSGs are rotated, no erroneous Basis involved, works fine.\n- For the Side-Top case only the large CSG is rotated, it has mentioned erroneous Basis, yet merging seems to work fine.\n\n(cc @fire)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2893906325/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2894165474","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106620#issuecomment-2894165474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106620","id":2894165474,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sgXXi","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_u